WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.420 --> 00:00:07.280
- As anyone in the world knows
or cares you no longer exist.

00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:13.980
- I believe you are destined for great things.

00:00:24.920 --> 00:00:27.380
- I think I made a mistake.

00:00:29.700 --> 00:00:31.120
- You'll never find out.

00:00:32.620 --> 00:00:33.900
- What really happened over there?

00:00:44.820 --> 00:00:45.940
- It was so blue.

00:00:49.440 --> 00:00:50.700
- I'm worried about you.

00:00:55.120 --> 00:00:57.900
- I really wanted to be this person
that you thought I was.

00:00:59.460 --> 00:01:01.960
- You know things most of the rest of us will never know.

00:01:02.880 --> 00:01:06.100
- Do you ever feel like your life has turned
into something you never intended?

00:01:12.740 --> 00:01:14.900
- It's just not a relationship you'd understand.

00:01:19.960 --> 00:01:22.960
- It's sorta weird being honored
for the worst day of your life.

00:01:24.320 --> 00:01:29.800
- When you love someone, you have to be careful with it.
You might never get it again.

